  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2713040,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2714540,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Buying a house with a studio function"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2717370,
    "dDurationMs": 3740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Right, if you have that... you want to have the space"
